      costs:['Agree specialist time, tools, transport and temporary shelter before treating them as available.','Dismantling may destroy measurements or a useful limited technique; copy only material that can safely be copied with permission.','A severed connection may affect a local protection. Identify that dependence before choosing destruction; do not invent a hidden dependence after a sound inspection.'],
      failures:['The chosen point cannot be reached or is no longer in the inspected state.','A stated warning exceeds the tested limit: stop that procedure and use the reviewed fallback.','A local interruption succeeds while another connection remains active; preserve the success and address the remaining branch.'],
