      costs:['Quote research, equipment, care and observer time before committing resources.','Temporary contact can create obligations of care and custody of sensitive records.','The attempt may need to be postponed or abandoned rather than exposed people being asked to absorb untested risk.'],
      failures:['The district cannot be independently isolated or the stop procedure does not work within its stated limits.','A participant withdraws or the observed warning exceeds the agreed threshold.','No response, inconclusive identity, unstable contact or a refusal occurs; do not turn that into automatic larger activation.'],
