      alternatives:['Preserve a non-operating research record and seek a better method later.','Attempt only an already supported communication method rather than embodiment.','Combine a shutdown of the dangerous district apparatus with preservation of a separately isolated small discovery; this is a new review, not simultaneous dismantling and use of the same component.'],
